matlab_extra_cases.txt, matlab_extra.mat and r_matlab_extra.m come from JDyn's test/matlab_extra_* (the Julia port's review of pydyn's MATLAB interpreter), generated by r_matlab_extra.m under Octave 8.4.
pydyn_extra_cases.txt and pydyn_extra.mat are pydyn's own further cases in the same format, generated by the same script under Octave 8.4 (with its file names changed to these).
pydyn_nd_cases.txt and pydyn_nd.mat: N-dimensional arrays (creation, indexing, assignment, growth, deletion, size
family, permute/reshape/repmat/cat, reductions along dimensions, broadcasting), same format and script.
pydyn_rng_cases.txt and pydyn_rng.mat: Octave's rand, randn, randi, randperm and rng (sequences of mixed calls,
state save/restore, seed conversions), same format and script.
